ontinual improvement. Corrective actions must be taken to address nonconformities and prevent recurrence. For GxP, this means proactively identifying and addressing deviations, implementing robust CAPA (Corrective and Preventive Action) systems, and using data to continuously improve processes and ensure ongoing compliance with regulations.\n	completed	f	\N	f	36	371	407	0	4107	\N	\N	\N	{"fallbackUsed": false}	1774350188970-81e9c8a4	2026-03-24 11:03:13.091+00	2026-03-24 11:03:13.091694+00	2026-03-24 11:03:13.091694+00
